flowchart TD
    start([Start]) --> wine{Do you use plain Wine?}
    wine -- Yes --> noWine[No build works with plain Wine.<br/>Install Proton 10+ with Steam or UMU.]
    noWine --> steam
    wine -- No --> steam{Do you prefer to launch from Steam?}
    steam -- Yes --> windows
    steam -- No --> umu{Is UMU installed and working?}
    umu -- No --> installUmu{Is it OK for you to install UMU?}
    installUmu -- No --> windows
    installUmu -- Yes --> features
    umu -- Yes --> features{Do you want MangoHud and<br/>other Linux features?}
    features -- Yes --> linux
    features -- No --> control{Do you want fine control over<br/>the installation and runtime?}
    control -- Yes --> linux
    control -- No --> both[Both builds work for you.<br/>But Linux may suit you better.]
    both --> linux

    windows[[Windows build]]
